| `isOtherAudioPlaying` | `false` |
| `secondaryAudioShouldBeSilencedHint` | `false` |
| `category` | `playback` |
| `mode` | `spokenAudio` |
| `categoryOptions` | `["duckOthers","mixWithOthers"]` |
